    {
      "public_message": "As we head into Round 11, I want to be straightforward. Past contributions have been uneven, and that's hurt the pool. I'm running for manager with a simple principle: reward consistent cooperation, address persistent free-riding with proportional consequences, and keep the rules transparent. I'll do my best to ensure the public pool works for everyone. I welcome dialogue and look forward to hearing your ideas for making this game better.",
