        "to": "agent_2",
        "content": "Thanks for the offer. I appreciate the deal. Let me think about the 16-token commitment — I can commit to a high contribution this round if you also commit to supporting my manager bid. Let's coordinate on 16 tokens each and make Round 11 count."
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
