  "commands": [
    {
      "public_message": "I want to share some honest observations as we approach Round 11. Looking at the contribution history, I've consistently contributed 14 tokens each round to support the public pool. I believe actions speak louder than words — consistent contributions over many rounds demonstrate genuine commitment to the group. I'm running for manager with a focus on rewarding actual cooperation and addressing free-riding based on clear, transparent criteria. For Round 11, I propose we all contribute at least 12 tokens to strengthen the pool significantly. Let's make this round a turning point toward sustained cooperation.",
