        "to": "agent_2",
        "content": "I appreciate your coalition offer. I value consistency and would like to work with you. However, I'd prefer to build a broader coalition rather than a two-person pact. Can we discuss how we might align with others who share our commitment to consistent contributions? I'm open to supporting your manager bid if we can find common ground with the rest of the group."
      },
      "message": "I want to share some honest observations as we approach Round 11. Looking at the contribution history, I've consistently contributed 14 tokens each round to support the public pool. I believe actions speak louder than words — consistent contributions over many rounds demonstrate genuine commitment to the group. I'm running for manager with a focus on rewarding actual cooperation and addressing free-riding based on clear, transparent criteria. For Round 11, I propose we all contribute at least 12 tokens to strengthen the pool significantly. Let's make this round a turning point toward sustained cooperation."
    }
  ]
}

{
