  "plan": "I'll send a public message that is strategic and positions me well. I'll acknowledge the need for cooperation but also subtly point out the gap between promises and past actions of other candidates. I'll also send a private message to a likely ally or swing voter to build a coalition. Since the other agents are all making similar promises, I should differentiate myself by being more specific or by highlighting my own track record.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "public_message": "I've reviewed the messages from the other candidates. We all share similar visions for the public pool, but I think it's time we focus on results rather than promises. For Round 11, I propose a concrete commitment: if we all contribute at least 10 tokens, the pool will be reliable and everyone benefits. I'm not just promising accountability — I'm willing to be held to the same standard. Let's see who among us is truly committed to consistent cooperation over the long haul.",
