        "content": "I noticed we've both had inconsistent contribution histories. I think we could benefit from aligning on a moderate contribution level — say 10 tokens — for Round 11. If we both commit to this, we can demonstrate good faith and encourage others to follow. I'd be happy to support your manager bid if you also support mine."
      }
    }
  ]
}

